  "finding": {
    "mobile_schema_dimension": "empty on all 98 sampled mobile events",
    "code_before": "TelemetryMetadata.prepare put analytics_schema as integer 1",
    "official_behavior": "GA4 does not parse integer app event parameters for event-scoped custom dimensions; web events differ",
    "source": "https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/14239696?hl=en",
    "fix": "categorical string v1; normal schema filters accept 1 or v1; legacy mobile events remain separate and are not relabeled"
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Counts describe this date/event scope and collected installation identities, not distinct people or production reliability.",
    "Android 2.0.0 includes builds before and after the lifecycle fix; app_version alone does not identify a build.",
    "New v1 code passed five local metadata tests; it has not been installed or verified in a new cloud sample.",
    "The dedicated history view was saved and its filters read back, but UI reloading clamped the date to local Sep 10. Data evidence uses the explicit Sep 11 backend query; the view itself was not observed displaying 98. Dia remote debugging became unavailable during final UI verification.",
    "Custom metric values are preserved in Venus response representation without claiming they are directly displayed milliseconds."
  ]
